      "answer": "D",
      "note": "D \\(\\mathop {\\lim }\\limits_{x \\to 1} \\left[ {f\\left( x \\right) + g\\left( x \\right)} \\right]\\)\\( = \\mathop {\\lim }\\limits_{x \\to 1} f\\left( x \\right) + \\mathop {\\lim }\\limits_{x \\to 1} g\\left( x \\right) = - 3 + 5 = 2\\)."
